diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 47fda00..0994c8b 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -6,7 +6,8 @@ Keep this file short. Detailed project rules live in [docs/reference/](docs/refe

 ## Required workflow

-- Use `dev check` when you are done with all changes and fix any pending issues.
+- Use `dev check` when you are done with code, config, dependency, migration, acceptance-test, or app-behaviour changes, and fix any pending issues.
+- Do not run `dev check` for docs-only, planning-only, prose-only, or kaizen-note edits unless Matt explicitly asks for it or the edit changes executable examples/scripts.
 - Use the included `:req` (`Req`) library for HTTP requests. Avoid `:httpoison`, `:tesla`, and `:httpc`.

 ## Reference map
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 58c3327..d7a4a9a 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -5,6 +5,8 @@ This repository is a monorepo:
 * `web/` contains the Phoenix application.
 * `acceptance-tests/` contains the Node, Cucumber.js, and Playwright acceptance tests.

